From 063fd90a7d1c5e6a0f31f3f3314726ae9f6f544c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SheepyLord <37598021+SheepyLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 10:16:44 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] VR: split GPU passes and distinguish command-list work from
 producer gaps

Record fine stages, all submitted context batches and render-side CPU running time. Keep the five public times as sums, log detail and write capture-frame timings.json. Charge SDK transfer intervals separately, and mark untracked coverage instead of claiming idle time.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
